+
+- C1 and C2 enter as `f(selected)-f(reference)` differences; named knockout skips the corresponding addition: [deployment.py lines 626–645](src/mcrl/stagec_v025/deployment.py#L626-L645).
+- C3 enters as an absolute interaction output, and C3 knockout sets that contribution to zero by skipping it. The final score is exactly `additive + interaction`: [deployment.py lines 717–733](src/mcrl/stagec_v025/deployment.py#L717-L733).
